12.27 Market Dynamics

BTC has been fluctuating since breaking through 89500 yesterday, and started to plummet directly before the delivery. Later in the evening, it drew a line, leaving us only to sigh and look forward to the weekend's market;

ETH can only follow the big coin. It seems to be one thing, but in reality, it is another. The DAT company, second only to BMNR, has begun to unfreeze their staking. Are they trying to escape?

SOL has dropped the most, but the rebound is still decent. It really depends on the overall market situation; recently, there hasn't been much independent market rhythm;

In 2025, the market value of meme coins plummeted by 65%, with trading volume decreasing by 72% during the same period;

Spot silver continues to hit new highs, refreshing the record high point to 78 dollars/ounce;

In 2026, U.S. cryptocurrency regulation may exhibit a dual-track pattern;

Spot gold rose to 4540 dollars/ounce, with significant increases in palladium and platinum
